  "question": "Which attraction can I find within a 50 kilometers radius while heading toward American Hotel, Freehold, NJ?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.990094 40.748387)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-74.273309 40.260464)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'attraction'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.990094 40.748387)',4326)::geography, 50000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.990094 40.748387)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
